            "review_title": "Review at Aviation Chamber",
            "review_text": "Lê L\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam5 contributions\n0\nPerfect chill night party\nOct 2019 • Friends\nVery nice bar. Afforable price. Nice atmosphere\nI come here after my friend’s suggestion and it’s a nice recommend!\nI enjoy Happy Hour (4-8pm) here and it’s worth to try!!! Yeah! I really love this.\nWhat’s more, Mr.Duc and Ms.Yen, the host, are supppppppper kind!!! They offer me a shooter called “New Born Bloody Mary” - go with up side down quail egg... SPEECHLESS!! Must try!!! Trust me!!\nFor sure, I will come back!!\nP/s: You can enjoy a free shooter of New born Bloody Mary on 31st Oct 2019. Why? ‘Cause it is Halloween night, dears :)))\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 27, 2019",
